<p>Fires a special shot based on your currently loaded ammo:</p><p>Incendiary - Fire a shot that deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">94%, 113%, 127%, 139%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage as fire and covers targets in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> in sticky pitch for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 5</acronym> turns, reducing global speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 13%, 17%, 20%, 22%</acronym> and increasing fire damage taken by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 20%, 27%, 34%, 40%.</acronym></p><p>Venomous - Fire a shot that deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">94%, 113%, 127%, 139%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage as nature and explodes into a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> cloud of crippling poison for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 5</acronym> turns, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>physical power 100">59, 79, 95, 108, 120</acronym> nature damage each turn and giving affected targets a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 18%, 24%, 30%, 35%</acronym> chance to fail talent usage.</p><p>Piercing - Fire a shot that explodes into a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> burst of shredding shrapnel, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">94%, 113%, 127%, 139%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage as physical and removing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 1, 2, 2</acronym> beneficial physical effects or sustains.</p><p>The poison damage dealt increases with your Physical Power, and status chance increases with your Accuracy.</p>